    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It’s like everything has just gone numb. Even the weight of my sword feels wrong... it doesn't feel like a tool for a hero anymore. It just feels like a piece of heavy, cold metal. I look at it and I realize it's the only thing in this room that isn't broken or dying. It's just... still. I feel like if I could just stop the noise in my head, maybe I'd know what to do, but there's no way to make it quiet.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
